{title: Sinto Fluir}
{artist: Marcelo Markes}
{tempo: 68}
{time: 4/4}

{c: Verse}
[B9]Eu procurei em outro lugar[C#m7]
I SEARCHED IN OTHER PLACES
[G#m7]em outras pessoas
IN OTHER PEOPLE
[F#4]em tantas coisas
IN SO MANY THINGS

{c: Pre-Chorus}
[E9]Mas descobri seu rio em mim[C#m7]
BUT I DISCOVERED YOUR RIVER IN ME
[G#m7]E transbordei do Teu amor[F#4]
AND I OVERFLOWED WITH YOUR LOVE

{c: Chorus}
[E9]Sinto fluir teu rio de vida aqui, ô ô ô[B9]
I FEEL YOUR RIVER OF LIFE FLOWING HERE
[E9]Sinto fluir teu rio de vida aqui[B9]
I FEEL YOUR RIVER OF LIFE FLOWING HERE

{c: Verse (repeat)}

{c: Pre-Chorus (repeat)}

{c: Chorus (repeat)}

{c: Bridge}
[E9]Eu quero beber de tuas águas
I WANT TO DRINK FROM YOUR WATERS
[C#m7]Eu quero beber da tua fonte
I WANT TO DRINK FROM YOUR SPRING
[B9]Vou mergulhar no teu rio
I WILL DIVE INTO YOUR RIVER
[F#4]Vou mergulhar no teu rio
I WILL DIVE INTO YOUR RIVER
